<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva inflation down 0.2 pct month-on-month.</title>
<headline>Geneva inflation down 0.2 pct month-on-month.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geneva consumer prices fell by 0.2 percent in November from October, for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.7 percent, the Geneva city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996    Oct 1996    Nov 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.2  pct   +0.0 pct    0.0</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.7 pct    +0.9 pct   +1.7</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)     103.9	 104.1	 103.2</p>
<p>Note - GENEVA is Switzerland's third-largest city. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
